Hmm — ⚠️ is U+26A0 U+FE0F. The existing SEVERITY_IMPORTANT_RE matches bare \u26A0 or word IMPORTANT. Use '\u26A0\uFE0F' or just '\u26A0'. To keep the thread classified 'important' by reviewVerdicts.threadSeverity, bare \u26A0 works.

Word BLOCKING → IMPORTANT: replace /(^|[^\w-])BLOCKING\b/gi with '$1IMPORTANT'. Careful not touch "non-blocking" — the boundary `(?:^|[^\w-])` ensures preceding char isn't hyphen. But a match consumes the preceding char as part of match with capture group — replace with '$1IMPORTANT' keeps it.

